      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably go but it's just a small hole, it doesn't look that bad once the bleeding stops. i just dont want to deal with the wait at a clinic. can i at least use some hydrogen peroxide or something like superglue to close it up so nothing gets in there? that should be fine right?",
